# www is not the canonical host (see site-config.mjs SITE_URL) — force it
# to the apex domain instead of silently serving duplicate content. Google
# was crawling https://www.countlink.app/ and correctly marking it an
# alternate of the apex page's canonical tag, but the intended fix is a
# redirect so www is never independently crawlable in the first place.
https://www.countlink.app/* https://countlink.app/:splat 301!

# ── Page consolidation, 2026-07-29 ────────────────────────────────────────
# Search Console showed 42 of 45 URLs stuck in "Discovered – currently not
# indexed" and the eight fixed-duration pages sharing *zero* impressions
# between them. Twelve pages were folded into three survivors so the crawl
# budget lands on pages that can actually win a query. Each target below is
# the page that genuinely absorbed the source's content — never a blanket
# redirect to the homepage, which Google treats as a soft 404.
#
# Every source page's prose was merged into its target before this landed;
# see the comments beside GROUPS and the interval/OBS entries in
# scripts/build-timer-pages.mjs for the reasoning per group.

# Eight fixed durations → the /timers/ durations hub, which carries the same
# board plus a section on what each length is used for.
/timers/5-minute-timer   /timers/ 301
/timers/10-minute-timer  /timers/ 301
/timers/15-minute-timer  /timers/ 301
/timers/20-minute-timer  /timers/ 301
/timers/30-minute-timer  /timers/ 301
/timers/45-minute-timer  /timers/ 301
/timers/60-minute-timer  /timers/ 301

# 25 minutes goes to the Pomodoro page instead of the hub: it IS the Pomodoro
# length, so that page is the closer intent match and the stronger target.
/timers/25-minute-timer  /timers/pomodoro-timer 301

# "Online stopwatch" is online-stopwatch.com's brand term; count-up is a
# Direction toggle on every page, so this was a preset with an unwinnable
# title. Its prose is the hub's "Counting up instead" section.
/timers/stopwatch        /timers/ 301

# Same OBS browser-source workflow described twice (51% unique prose each).
/timers/twitch-stream-timer /timers/obs-countdown-timer 301

# One work/rest engine, three sports' names on it. The protocols survive as a
# preset table on the interval page.
/timers/tabata-timer       /timers/interval-timer 301
/timers/boxing-round-timer /timers/interval-timer 301
